<title>SOUTH KOREA: S.Korean Sunkyong wins $105 mln Thai plant order.</title>
<headline>S.Korean Sunkyong wins $105 mln Thai plant order.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-07-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Korea's Sunkyong Engineering and Construction Ltd said on Friday it had won a $105 million condensate splitter order from Thailand's Petrochain Co Ltd.  </p>
<p>The plant, which is scheduled for completion in May 1999 in southeastern Rayong province, would have a condensate processing capacity of 64,000 barrels per day.</p>
<p>The plant was awarded on a turn-key basis.</p>
<p>-- Seoul Newsroom (822) 727 5643</p>
</text>
